<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of Aug 1.</p>
<p>				     Aug 01/July 31   Aug 01/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.02		 8.64</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.03		 6.88</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.13		14.62</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			   -0.24		56.22</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.79		40.65</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.81		41.28</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.39		19.20</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.55		35.57</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.82		51.00</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.85		49.49</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.53		34.93</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.22	     105.57</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas)</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,742,772,200,920</p>
<p>  Fixed income funds			  2,015,538,621,105</p>
<p>  Money market funds			  3,368,970,306,704</p>
<p>  International funds			   106,068,671,719</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    252,194,601,392</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
